      "sequence_position": 12,
      "problem": "Let $g(y)$ be a profit for product $y,$ where $y\\in \\{3,7,11,15\\}.$ We want to write the best product $\\overset{^}{y}$ as \"the value of $y$ that makes $g(y)$ as large as possible.\"\n\nWhich of the following correctly defines $\\overset{^}{y}?$",
